break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポカ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/poka_0704_16_fjseijfeihfeiueiufehsiuhsefiuishusei.png","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"（ちなみにポカはきんちょーで引くくらいガチガチでした）"}],"source":"official"},"ofc-hina-39798":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"いとしさとせつなさと食欲と"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ども。ポカです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"キャプテンが出演する\n今日放送の「ワールドドキドキビデオ」に潜入してきました～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/poka_20210623_ittgh8th9rh9f.png","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しょーげき映像をみながら、\n笑うのも泣くのもおどろくのもNGなストイックな番組～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"むひょーじょーなら\nオールタイムワールドワイドチャンピオンの\nポカなら楽勝ですが、キャプテンはたいへんだったみたいです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに、\nそんなチャンピオンであるポカが、\nつい かんじょーをあらわにしてしまった瞬間がこちら～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/poka_20210623_j8f8r8ht8gh8th8.png","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さすがに照れたよね～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どの瞬間かはひみつ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は他にも、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「林修のニッポンドリル」だったり、\n「みえる」、「声春っ！」、「ヒノマルソウル～舞台裏の英雄たち～ 涙と歓喜の大感謝SP」から、\nみんな大好き「キョコロヒー」まで盛りだくさん～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんだけ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さてさて、\nポカはライブに向けて体づくりしなきゃなので、今日はこのへんで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また明日～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポカ"}],"source":"official"}}